{"page":20202,"part":1,"text":"论作字之始\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n论作字之始\n\n伏羲一画开天，发造化之机，而文字始立。自是有龙书、穗书、云书、鸟书、虫书、龟书、螺书、蝌蚪书、钟鼎书以至虎爪、蚊脚、虾蟆子，皆取形而作书。古帝启萌，仓颉肇体，嗣有六书，而书法乃备。史籀从此变而为大篆，李斯又变而为小篆，，王次仲又变而为八分，程邈又变而为隶书，蔡邕又变而为飞白。飞白者，隶书之捷也，隶书又八分之捷也。八分减小篆之半，小篆又减大篆之半，去古渐远，书体渐真，故六义八体既行于世，而楷法于是乎生矣。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20202,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"45f85ae4c924f73eeb33b5bbadf34d592448412655ba678055bb924c34b8fe18","textSha256":"45f85ae4c924f73eeb33b5bbadf34d592448412655ba678055bb924c34b8fe18","fileSha256":"45f85ae4c924f73eeb33b5bbadf34d592448412655ba678055bb924c34b8fe18","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20202-work-141.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"书法约言 · 论作字之始","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/45dRGSQt5JFWbJ3FLV2pD8","originalPages":[581],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":5,"sourceTextSha256":"f41a4f694efcb889c4546cfbf9bbca19bdd9cb25d224c0233ab9476bed00d6c7","id":"local-581-6-11","page_id":581,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":6,"rawEnd":11,"reviewedTextSha256":"41bc5f59a68dbdded7d7f3eebf3aa884b33e12ea49632a8f6bd23a383fb1298b","displayUnitOrigins":[[6,7],[7,8],[8,9],[9,10],[10,11]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":581,"part":3,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"宋品宣","verifiedAt":"2026-10-15T12:36:48.613Z","revision":"41bc5f59a68dbdded7d7f3eebf3aa884b33e12ea49632a8f6bd23a383fb1298b","textSha256":"41bc5f59a68dbdded7d7f3eebf3aa884b33e12ea49632a8f6bd23a383fb1298b","fileSha256":"337dfa6c51e668ea709348ab712a3393735bf97aa642fd0d59f41a894d9ef262","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-18-part3-feedback-review/member-input/第3份-逐页校勘 (1).txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-18-part3-feedback-review/member-input/第3份-TXT校验表 (1).csv"}},{"start":7,"end":8,"sourceTextSha256":"01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b","id